      <activity id="9e3f2ae9-0ac4-5de6-93f1-6e7e6d1c5ed4" activityNameId="9f46ee9d-3560-51ae-8fbe-e3a6da3d0c2b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Delivery and return well for groundwater heat pump, 9m,</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Delivery and return well for groundwater heat pump, 9m,
Inventory for the production of a delivery well 9m deep and a return well 7m deep for a groundwater heat pump with a lifetime of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Förder- und Schluckbrunenn für Grundwasser Wärmepumpe; 
UUID: b62936dc-4866-3d40-b387-58d4e5a7a07c
Infrastructure of the  delivery and return well which is connected to the groundwater, including all material inputs (pipes and inert materials) and also the energy use for building the wells with machines.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b62936dc-4866-3d40-b387-58d4e5a7a07c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
